{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This pack includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Premium squad of four Level 4 mortarmen and one Level 4 engineer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squad members are armed with the premium SVT-40 (AG) rifle (Rank IV, USSR)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique buildable structure for the Engineer \u2014 the AG-2 automatic grenade launcher</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosive Pack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300 Gold</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squad members are armed with the SVT-40 semi-automatic rifle, renowned for its reliability and effectiveness. The rifle\u2019s stock is finished in a light varnish, and the bolt is chrome-plated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At medium and long ranges, the team is supported by an 82 mm BM-41 mortar. Its 3 kg bombs, descending on a high-arc trajectory, detonate over trenches and machine-gun nests, showering them with fragments and forcing the enemy to abandon their positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The squad\u2019s Engineer has a standout capability: the deployment of a new, devastating weapon \u2014 the AG-2, an automatic grenade launcher designed by Taubin. It can deliver a withering burst of fire for a short period and turn the tide of battle on a key sector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3905660?t=1758631520","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3905660?t=1758631520","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905660/a464bea557d63651be9306f6abd965051b818ed1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758631520","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905660/a464bea557d63651be9306f6abd965051b818ed1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758631520","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO"